⚡️🇦🇺 Federal MP Helen Haines remains in critical condition at Melbourne’s Alfred Hospital after being struck by a Toyota LandCruiser outside her electorate office in Wangaratta, Victoria. A 43-year-old man has been arrested, while Australian Federal Police, Victoria Police and ASIO investigate the incident.

Prime Minister Anthony Albanese has described the incident as potential terrorism.

